00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:37.620
I mean, I'm thinking out loud here, all nonessential
travel is going to have to be stopped.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.070
What counts as essential travel?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.320
I don't know, but you've got to define it
somehow.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.050
People need to stop moving around.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:47.450
Red states are filled with people just partying
